{
    "test_name": "MOB.711_AssetLookup_Column_Search",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.711_AssetLookup_Column_Search",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.711` The **column picker's search** (`RecordInfoTable`, `Find Column(s)`) \u2014 the third\nunproven `SearchInput`, and one no list had ever mentioned: it filters which COLUMNS the\nrecord table can show, not which records are listed.\n- \u26a0\ufe0f **It lives inside a `Menu.Dropdown`**, behind the `table-columns` ActionIcon \u2014 it does\n  not exist until that menu is opened. The first version of this test assumed it was on\n  the panel and failed with *No element found*.\n- **Matched pair on the picker's checkbox list**: `Desc` must leave `Description`\n  standing while shrinking the list, a nonsense term must empty it, and clearing must\n  restore it.\n- \ud83d\uded1 **No checkbox is ever ticked.** `selectedColumns` persists to **localStorage**, so a\n  tick would permanently change which columns every later run displays.\n- `RecordInfoTable` is shared, so this covers Asset Lookup, the Collector's asset details\n  and the AV job's asset rows by construction (the `MOB.710` argument).\n- **READ-ONLY** and self-restoring.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Asset Lookup",
            "Search",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
